{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742860/extras/hyperforma_gif2_mini_cut.gif?t=1750328765\" /></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE FUTURE IS HERE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The civilization of the past has vanished, leaving behind only empty cities and the mysterious Ancient Network. 256 years later, a nameless explorer descends into its cold digital depths to uncover the secrets of the vanished world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an atmospheric journey inspired by the works of William Gibson, Dan Simmons, and Peter Watts. Immerse yourself in the vast cyberspace, communicate with enigmatic Titanic Interfaces, and hack their complex defense systems. The secrets hidden within the Network await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742860/extras/hyperforma_gif3_mini_cut.gif?t=1750328765\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742860/extras/HF_Steam_Symbols_3.png?t=1750328765\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mesmerizing Atmosphere</strong><br>Explore a stunning digital world filled with mysteries and enigmas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742860/extras/HF_Steam_Symbols_2.png?t=1750328765\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique Hacking Mechanics</strong><br>Master an intuitive yet deep hacking system to penetrate ancient defense forms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742860/extras/HF_Steam_Symbols_4.png?t=1750328765\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stylish Visuals and Audio </strong><br>Immerse yourself in a minimalist aesthetic with a powerful soundtrack that enhances immersion.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742860/extras/HF_Steam_Symbols_1.png?t=1750328765\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deep Story</strong><br>Uncover the story of a vanished civilization by interacting with digital titans and exploring found archives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742860/extras/hyperforma_gif1_mini_cut.gif?t=1750328765\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DEFINITIVE EDITION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Extended Edition includes two additional DLCs, &quot;Lost Archives,&quot; featuring 60 extra defense forms, as well as improved and entirely new cutscenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlock the secrets of cyberspace and touch the mysteries of the ancient digital gods.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2742860?t=1750328765","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2742860?t=1750328765","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742860/670bf45cd150bdfe285aae428b9748626c1c7663/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750328765","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742860/670bf45cd150bdfe285aae428b9748626c1c7663/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750328765","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_